        "en": "Pet owners express deep appreciation for the hospital's veterinarians and assistants, frequently highlighting clinicians like Dr. Reilly and Dr. An. Staff members are praised for their genuine tenderness when handling severe illnesses, delicate surgeries, and compassionate end-of-life care. Clients feel their companions are treated with true respect."
