        "en": "Lifesaving subsidized and low-cost care"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Clients emphasize the hospital's vital role in providing affordable veterinary treatments and subsidized emergency surgeries. Multiple reviewers state that the ASPCA saved their pets' lives when private veterinary clinics were financially out of reach. Subsidized medications and transparent billing receive frequent praise."
      }
    },
    {
