      "title": {
        "en": "Successful surgeries and vital recoveries"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Reviewers credit the surgical staff with performing life-saving emergency procedures and extensive dental extractions for senior pets. Companion animals routinely make strong recoveries following complicated interventions and extended monitoring. Pet parents express profound gratitude for medical outcomes that restored their animals' health."
      }
    }
